      "text": "CarmaMap should have TopicMap Compatible props and functionality\n\nCurrent Geoportalmap relies on fuzzy search lib to handle selections in 3d.\nthis is not what TopicMap does\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CarmaMap should have TopicMap Compatible props and functionality\n\nCurrent Geoportalmap relies on fuzzy search lib to handle selections in 3d.\nthis is not what TopicMap does\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
